Paste your Cloudflare Tunnel token here (one line, no quotes), then save this
file as `cloudflare_tunnel_token` (drop the .example suffix).

Get the token from the Cloudflare Zero Trust dashboard:
  Networks -> Tunnels -> Create a tunnel -> Docker -> copy the value passed to
  the `--token` / `TUNNEL_TOKEN` argument (NOT the full install command).

chmod 600 the real file after creating it:
  chmod 600 secrets/cloudflare_tunnel_token

Never commit the real file — it's git-ignored by default (see .gitignore).
